<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Thank you so much for taking the time to contact us about your recent flight. </font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We want your journey to be as simple and seamless as possible, so it was concerning to hear about the wait to board {!Case.Flight_Number__c}. We know the ability to board via our priority boarding lane is important to our most loyal customers like you, and sincerely regret the impact this had on the start of your journey. </font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If not available at departure port add:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We provide this premium boarding lane in Brisbane, Melbourne, Perth, Canberra, Sydney and Adelaide Domestic airports, but do not currently have this facility available in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c}.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If no pre-boarding for children use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Taking little ones on a journey comes with its own unique challenges and we know parents appreciate pre-boarding so they can get settled for the flight ahead. I understand your disappointment when we were unable to provide this prior to {!Case.Flight_Number__c}. We are happy to provide this service when time permits, but on {!Case.TECH_Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}, <b><i>-explain what happened, ie, the Captain requested immediate boarding, so the aircraft could depart on time and this required our airport team to slightly alter the boarding process-</i></b>.</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are constantly looking at ways to develop our service, and feedback from our customers is essential in achieving this goal. I’ve passed your comments on to our Airport Management in {!Case.Departure_Airport__c} and thank you very much for getting in touch. We look forward to welcoming you on board again soon.</font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2"><br><br></font><p style=""></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia&nbsp;</font></p><p style="text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>